        <Item class="StringValue" referent="3">
          <Properties>
            <string name="Name">README</string>
            <string name="Value"><![CDATA[Put car body models here (as .rbxm / .rbxmx files exported from Studio, or
straight into ReplicatedStorage.CarsAssets.Cars in the place).
A model's pivot must be at ground level in the middle of the car, front = -Z.
Then add `customModel = "<ModelName>"` to a car in src/shared/CarCatalog.luau.
]]></string>
