-- 6 Cherry, 7 Orange, 8 Yellow, 9 Lime, 10 Green, 11 Olive, 12 Teal, 13 Sky,
-- 14 Blue, 15 Midnight, 16 Purple, 17 Pink, 18 Sand, 19 Brown, 20 Bronze,
-- 21 Gold, 22 Mint, 23 Lavender, 24 Toxic
